### GET kategori (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### GET detail kategori dummy (public, ID 1 pada database baru)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### GET produk (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### GET detail produk dummy (public, ID 1 pada database baru)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### POST kategori tanpa token (harus 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kategori Percobaan Stockify"
}

### POST kategori dengan token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kategori Percobaan Stockify"
}

### Detail kategori (ganti ID sesuai response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### POST produk tanpa token (harus 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse Demo",
  "sku": "STK-DEMO-999",
  "description": "Produk pengujian",
  "price": 150000,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### POST produk dengan token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse Demo",
  "sku": "STK-DEMO-999",
  "description": "Produk pengujian",
  "price": 150000,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### PATCH produk dengan token (ganti ID jika berbeda)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 20,
  "price": 175000
}

### DELETE produk dengan token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH kategori tanpa token (harus 401)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nama kategori edit"
}

